Superpowers Lite is a Codex-native adaptation of the MIT-licensed
obra/superpowers project, forked from the MIT-licensed superpowers-codex
project, which itself incorporates workflow material from the MIT-licensed
pcvelz/superpowers fork.

Original copyright notices are retained in
plugins/superpowers/LICENSE. This repository adds Codex-specific plugin
packaging, custom-agent role routing, installation checks, public
documentation, and the process-weight reductions described in CHANGES.md.
